  "description": "How the Atlas checks work before it takes effect: adversarial validation by mandate, the Tenth Man rule making unanimity itself trigger assigned dissent, review anchored to a different source document",
  "orientation": "How the Atlas checks work before it takes effect: adversarial validation by mandate, the Tenth Man rule making unanimity itself trigger assigned dissent, review anchored to a different source document than construction, and blame relocated from person to process by rule. Set against that: the voter-facing Executive Document has the weakest independence guarantee in the chain, and the fastest powers are excluded from validation precisely because they have no pause delay.",
